            p("Retries, timeouts, encryption between services, metrics and tracing are needed in every service, in every language. A service mesh moves this plumbing out of the code into proxies that run next to each service. Istio, for example, adds service-to-service encryption with mutual TLS, load balancing and monitoring with few or no code changes [[istio]]."),
